{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "project_summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Project overview",
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "project_summary", "field": "db_empty", "truthy": false },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "project_summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "KPIStrip",
                "id": "project_summary_kpistrip",
                "props": {
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "label": "Files",
                      "field": "file_count"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Objects",
                      "field": "total_objects",
                      "format": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "References",
                      "field": "total_links",
                      "format": "number"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "KPIStrip",
                "id": "cluster_count_kpistrip",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "cluster_count"
                },
                "props": {
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "label": "Clusters",
                      "field": "count",
                      "format": "number",
                      "onClick": {
                        "action": "navigate",
                        "args": {
                          "path": "/cluster"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "KPIStrip",
                "id": "project_summary_meta_kpistrip",
                "props": {
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "label": "FM version",
                      "field": "fm_versions"
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "DDR info",
                      "field": "ddr_status",
                      "format": "badge",
                      "badgeTone": {
                        "full": "ok",
                        "partial": "warning",
                        "none": "warning"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Last import",
                      "field": "last_import",
                      "format": "date:relative"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "XmlConvertControl",
                "props": {
                  "mode": "navigate"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "object_counts",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Objects"
        },
        "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "project_summary", "field": "db_empty", "truthy": false },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "object_counts"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "object_counts_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Scripts",
                  "field": "scripts",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "Script"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Tables",
                  "field": "tables",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "BaseTable"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Fields",
                  "field": "fields",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "Field"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "TOs",
                  "field": "occurrences",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "TableOccurrence"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Relationships",
                  "field": "relationships",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "Relationship"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Layouts",
                  "field": "layouts",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "Layout"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Value lists",
                  "field": "value_lists",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "ValueList"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Custom fns",
                  "field": "custom_functions",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "CustomFunction"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Variables",
                  "field": "variables",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "applyFilter",
                    "args": {
                      "type": "Variable"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "XmlEmptyStateCard",
        "props": {
          "span": 12
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "files_overview",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Files"
        },
        "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "project_summary", "field": "db_empty", "truthy": false },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "files_overview"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "files_overview_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "File_Name",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "defaultSort": { "field": "File_Name", "dir": "asc" },
              "pageSizeOptions": ["all", 10, 25, 50, 100],
              "defaultPageSize": "auto",
              "autoPageSizeThreshold": 100,
              "keyboardNav": true,
              "stateKey": "fmlab.home.files",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "File_Name",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "FileMaker_Version",
                  "label": "FM version"
                },
                {
                  "field": "script_count",
                  "label": "Scripts",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "table_count",
                  "label": "Tables",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "field_count",
                  "label": "Fields",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "layout_count",
                  "label": "Layouts",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "cf_count",
                  "label": "CFs",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "Has_DDR_INFO",
                  "label": "DDR",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "badgeTone": {
                    "yes": "ok",
                    "no": "warning"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "Import_Timestamp",
                  "label": "Imported",
                  "format": "date:relative"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openFile",
                "args": {
                  "file": "{{File_Name}}"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "recent_changes",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Recently changed"
        },
        "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "recent_state", "field": "has_changes", "truthy": true },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Sparkline",
            "id": "recent_change_trend",
            "data": { "dataset": "change_trend" },
            "props": {
              "label": "Individual changes per month, last 12 months up to the data state",
              "valueField": "n",
              "labelField": "month",
              "height": 40,
              "maxWidth": 360,
              "onPointClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": { "id": "changes", "from": "{{from_at}}", "to": "{{to_at}}" }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "recent_view_chips",
            "props": {
              "param": "recent",
              "default": "objects",
              "options": [
                { "value": "objects", "label": "Single changes" },
                { "value": "sessions", "label": "Work sessions" }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "recent_changes_table",
            "data": { "dataset": "recent_changes" },
            "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "recent_state", "field": "show_list", "truthy": true },
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "uuid",
              "density": "compact",
              "searchable": false,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "at", "label": "Changed", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "type", "label": "Type", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "name", "label": "Object" },
                { "field": "file", "label": "File", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "person", "label": "Person", "nowrap": true }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": { "uuid": "{{uuid}}", "file": "{{file}}", "type": "{{type}}" }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "recent_sessions_table",
            "data": { "dataset": "recent_sessions" },
            "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "recent_state", "field": "show_sessions", "truthy": true },
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "session_key",
              "density": "compact",
              "searchable": false,
              "columns": [
                { "field": "started", "label": "Start", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "ended", "label": "End", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "minutes", "label": "Minutes", "align": "right", "format": "number", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "person", "label": "Person", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "objects", "label": "Changes", "align": "right", "format": "number", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "files", "label": "Files", "nowrap": true },
                { "field": "types", "label": "Types" }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": { "id": "changes", "from": "{{from_at}}", "to": "{{to_at}}", "person": "{{person_key}}" }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No work sessions yet."
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "NavButton",
            "id": "recent_changes_all",
            "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "recent_state", "field": "show_list", "truthy": true },
            "props": {
              "label": "All changes",
              "variant": "link",
              "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard", "args": { "id": "changes" } }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "NavButton",
            "id": "recent_sessions_all",
            "visibleWhen": { "dataset": "recent_state", "field": "show_sessions", "truthy": true },
            "props": {
              "label": "All work sessions",
              "variant": "link",
              "onClick": { "action": "openDashboard", "args": { "id": "changes", "group": "sessions" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {
          "span": 4,
          "variant": "navtile"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "nav_dashboards"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "NavButton",
            "id": "dashboards",
            "props": {
              "label": "Dashboards",
              "subtitle": "Prepared analyses",
              "icon": "layout-dashboard",
              "showCount": true,
              "onClick": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "args": {
                  "path": "/dashboard"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {
          "span": 4,
          "variant": "navtile"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "nav_tests"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "NavButton",
            "id": "tests",
            "props": {
              "label": "Tests",
              "subtitle": "Curated analysis tests",
              "icon": "check-square",
              "showCount": true,
              "onClick": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "args": {
                  "path": "/tests"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {
          "span": 4,
          "variant": "navtile"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "nav_docs"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "NavButton",
            "id": "docs",
            "props": {
              "label": "Docs",
              "subtitle": "Installed documentation sources",
              "icon": "book",
              "showCount": true,
              "onClick": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "args": {
                  "path": "/docs"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "id": "markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Tips\n\n- **Search:** type a name into the search box to filter objects — the dashboard hides automatically.\n- **Files:** clicking a row in the files table opens that file's detail view; column headers sort. With the keyboard: Tab into the table, ↑/↓ move between files (across pages), Enter opens the file.\n- **Navigation:** *Dashboards* opens curated analyses and SQL queries, *Tests* bundles curated checks, *Docs* shows installed documentation sources."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
